  "meaning": "The host's pinned bundle, read by a declared provider so that no host code reads it. read-document reads one document of the bundle and answers it only when the SHA-256 of its exact bytes is the digest the caller names: the manifest under the pin, a capability's document under the digest the manifest names. A missing document, another digest, or bytes that are not UTF-8 fail the read. It opens no connection and holds no credential.",
